menu "AirMonitor"

    config APP_SELFTEST
        bool "Run HTTP self-test at boot (development only)"
        default n
        help
            Drives the device's own HTTP API over the lwIP loopback
            interface and logs SELFTEST PASS/FAIL lines on the console.
            Some phases save settings and reboot (see main/CMakeLists.txt
            for the APP_SELFTEST_* phase switches). Never ship this.

endmenu
